SUMMARY:Mindful Masculinity Men’s Group
DESCRIPTION:We Meet Bi-Weekly Every Other Wednesday | 7 – 8:30 pm | $15 \nAugust 5 \, 2026 \nThrough open dialogue\, mindfulness\, and other calming practices we quiet the mind\, open the heart\, and deepen our connection to ourselves and each other. \nThe meetings are hosted by Leo\, mindfulness coach\, teacher\, and dad. \nWe start by sharing our wins and challenges\, honoring each voice without judgment or advice. \nWe dive into practices that help us release stress\, shift perspectives\, and bring  awareness and resilience into our lives. \nEach week\, we focus on a different topic to help guide our lives. Together\, we explore themes of trust\, accomplishments\, family\, rest\, intimacy\, and presence — discovering new ways to move through the world as mindful men. \nCome as you are.  Leave more grounded\, connected\, and inspired. \nConnect with Leo and the group\non Instagram\n@holdingpresence
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/mindful-masculinity-mens-group-2/
LOCATION:The Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, loft #2\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/mindful-masculinity.jpg
END:VEVENT
