LAST-MODIFIED:20260618T183728Z
UID:9707-1787486400-1787497200@thespaceforart.com
SUMMARY:Reimagining the Tarot: An Intuitive Collage Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Reimagining the Tarot: An Intuitive Collage Workshop\nWhat if the Tarot could speak in your voice? \nIn this exploratory workshop\, we’ll dive into the rich history and symbolism of the Major Arcana — exploring the colors\, archetypes\, and allegories that have given these iconic cards their power for centuries. Then\, we’ll turn that wisdom over to your own creative instincts. \nNo art experience needed. No tarot experience needed. Just an open mind and a willingness to listen to what’s stirring inside you. \nYou’ll choose a card that calls to you\, journal your reflections\, and then bring it to life through drawing\, painting\, or collage — reimagining it through your own symbols\, style\, and personal expression. The goal isn’t perfection; it’s presence. We’re letting intuition lead. \n📅 Sunday\, August 23 | 12:00 pm – 3:00 pm 📍 The Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Loft #2\, Montclair\, NJ 🎟 $50 | Returning participants: $30 (arrive at 1:30 pm) \nWhat You’ll Do: \n\nExplore the Major Arcana and the art of symbolic storytelling\nChoose a card that resonates with you in the moment\nJournal your insights and reflections\nSketch and plan your own symbolic design\nCreate your unique version of the card through your medium of choice.  Collage materials\, magazines\, paint\, colored pencils and markers will be available.\n\nAll materials provided. Just bring your imagination\, an open mind\, a tarot deck\, and a notebook. \nThis is an ongoing series — each session builds on the last. Returning participants are welcome to skip the first segment and join at 1:30 pm for the creative portion only with a $30 ticket. \n  \nYour Guide Gina Devine\nInstagram: @gina.devine \n\nGina Devine is an esoteric artist\, intuitive tarot reader\, writer\, educator and guide. \nShe has provided thousands of readings for people all over the world\, and leads both protection and tarot workshops. Her approach to guidance is loving\, grounded and human. Although she also teaches traditional tarot classes\, her tea and tarot discussion group was birthed from the knowing that people are more inclined to to be in tune with the archetypes of the cards and the messages they bring when they are allowed space to enjoy the tarot in a more casual setting – instead of forcefully trying to memorize them. The same way we find joy in discussing a book in community\, the cards also call for us to convene together around them. Her approach is philosophical\, therapeutic and creative\, and she is on a mission to guide people toward unearthing a more intimate and honest relationship with their inner knowing through the art of divination. You can find her services and more at soulcentrictarot.com \n\n👉 Sign up for the Soul Centric Tarot Newsletter \n \n 
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/reimagining-the-tarot-a-creative-intuitive-art-workshop-2/
CATEGORIES:Art,Tarot,Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Spring-2026-flyers.png
END:VEVENT
